                            {
                                "example_id": "752c5cef-219f-4bc6-8e78-019c6eec0c65",
                                "sense_id": "71fef1ba-ae28-34ef-a3e7-9ad88cb6ff6a",
                                "text": "Оде́та она́ была́ по-крестья́нски, и шли о́ба супру́га друг за дру́гом, неся́ на плеча́х коромы́сло, на кото́ром висе́ла подвя́занная холщо́вым концо́м расписна́я лубо́чная коробья́ с прида́ным.",
                                "translation": "She was dressed in peasant clothes, and the two spouses walked one behind the other, carrying a yoke on their shoulders from which a decorated bast box containing a dowry hung on a canvas strap.",
                                "english": "She was dressed in peasant clothes, and the two spouses walked one behind the other, carrying a yoke on their shoulders from which a decorated bast box containing a dowry hung on a canvas strap."
                            }
                        ]
